# Senda Sovereign Search — Periodic Crawl & Maintenance Cron Jobs

# Run polite background crawl across ethical seeds every 6 hours
0 */6 * * * senda /opt/senda/venv/bin/senda crawl --seeds-file /etc/senda/ethical_seeds.txt --max-pages 500 --max-depth 2 > /dev/null 2>&1

# Run daily SQLite WAL truncate and query optimizer at 03:30 AM
30 3 * * * senda sqlite3 /var/lib/senda/senda.db "PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE); PRAGMA optimize;" > /dev/null 2>&1
